   1. People

   Twenty resources across nine teams, spanning all nine access roles and all four
   access scopes, including a leaver and an unfilled post.
   
   auth_user_id is deliberately left null. guard_person_identity() refuses a login
   attached on insert, and linking is an owner-only act through
   public.ppm_link_person_login(). To turn one of these into a real tester, create
   the Supabase Auth user first and then link it.
   
   manager_id is not set here either: the same trigger derives it from
   legacy_payload->>'managerResourceId', so the hierarchy resolves itself.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------- */

