r but functional.","decisionRequired":"","dependencyScope":"","dependencyDirection":"","provider":"","recipient":"","requiredByDate":"","dependencyConfidence":"","impactIfMissed":"","relatedProject":"","relatedMilestone":"","acceptanceCriteria":"","auditHistory":[],"demoDataSet":"STAGE-14A"}$ppm$::jsonb, 'Issue', 'Identity verification automated pass rate below assumption', 'In Progress', 'The business case assumed an 85% automated identity pass rate. Testing across 1,200 sample applications shows 79%, so about one applicant in five needs an assisted route that was never designed.', 'Tom Bradshaw', 'Tom Bradshaw', '2026-03-02', '2026-05-01', 'High', 'Escalation Required', '2026-08-03', '', '', '', '', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Monthly', '2026-03-02', 'Without an assisted route, one in five applicants abandons at the identity step, which is the problem the project exists to fix.', 'Adds about six weeks. This is why schedule is Amber and scope is Red.', 'The supplier''s quoted rate was based on a broader population than the society''s, which skews older and has more members sharing an address.', 'Change request to the change control board on 2 October with two options: build the assisted route now and re-baseline to January, or release without it in December and follow with a second release.', 'Tom Bradshaw', '2026-09-14', null, 'Applicants failing automated checks can route to the existing paper identity process, which is poor but functional.', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, $ppm$[]$ppm$::jsonb, (select id from public.projects where project_code = 'PRJ-00010')
