ost of the benefit.","decisionRequired":"","dependencyScope":"","dependencyDirection":"","provider":"","recipient":"","requiredByDate":"","dependencyConfidence":"","impactIfMissed":"","relatedProject":"","relatedMilestone":"","acceptanceCriteria":"","auditHistory":[],"demoDataSet":"STAGE-14A"}$ppm$::jsonb, 'Issue', 'No outcome monitoring data for two legacy products', 'In Progress', 'The Consumer Duty value assessment cannot evidence fair value for the 2009 and 2011 legacy ISA products because outcome monitoring data was never captured for them.', 'Priya Raghavan', 'Priya Raghavan', '2026-02-16', '2026-04-17', 'Critical', 'Escalated', '2026-08-03', '', '', '', '', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, 'Monthly', '2026-02-16', 'The society cannot demonstrate fair value for two products still held by about 8,600 members, which is a regulatory exposure independent of this project.', 'Adds about twelve weeks and puts the mandatory April tax year date at risk. This is why the project is Red.', 'Outcome monitoring was introduced in 2023 and applied prospectively to products then on sale. Closed products were never brought into scope.', 'Agree remediation with Risk and Compliance by 9 October, then present two options to the board on 14 October: descope the two products, or defer the legacy withdrawal to July.', 'Priya Raghavan', '2026-09-14', null, 'The new range can launch in April with the legacy withdrawal handled separately, preserving most of the benefit.', null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, $ppm$[]$ppm$::jsonb, (select id from public.projects where project_code = 'PRJ-00011')
