uest is with the change control board; see the decision register.","benefitsUpdate":"Benefit measures are on track against the approved measurement approach. No change to forecast benefit.","returnToGreenActions":"A scope change request is with the change control board. If the assisted route is deferred to a second release the project returns to the original December date and to Green; if it is approved in scope the plan re-baselines to mid-January and holds at Amber.","sponsorComments":"","status":"Draft","version":1,"dueDate":"2026-08-05","submittedDate":"","approvedDate":"","preparedBy":"Tom Bradshaw","preparedByResourceId":"RES-0104","approverName":"Nadia Kaur","approverResourceId":"RES-0112","createdAt":"2026-07-31T09:45:00.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-06T14:30:00.000Z","demoDataSet":"STAGE-14A"}$ppm$::jsonb, (select id from public.projects where project_code = 'PRJ-00010')
